'''Golden Doge''' (ゴールデンわんこ, ''Gōruden Wanko'', '''Golden Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[GOLD RUSH#The Midas Touch|The Midas Touch]]. It was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Golden Doge
|image = E 336.png
|appearance = [[GOLD RUSH#The Midas Touch|The Midas Touch]]<br>
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 3|Infernal Tower - Floor 3]]<br>
[[Golden Tower/Floor 50|Golden Tower - Floor 50]]
|money drop = 750¢ - 2,962¢
}}

==Enemy==
It has a bit faster movement than the normal [[Doge]], is tougher and does much more damage. When killed, it gives almost 3,000¢ with all [[Treasure]]s.

